rsx_metal_backend: record the staging arena into a pooled MTLBuffer (open upstream PR, imported as is).

Every commit copied the staging arena into a new MTLBuffer (newBufferWithBytes); Resistance 3's present thread commits several times a frame.

Measured in Resistance 3 as one batch (#437 #438 #440 #458 #459 #465 #466), Home level, stick turning, two runs each:
22.7 -> 24.2 fps; present thread busy 640 -> 556 of 657 `sample` ticks. Frames of a scripted run unchanged.

Upstream: PR #440 (drop this file when the pin contains it).

---

diff --git a/libs/video/rsx_metal_backend.m b/libs/video/rsx_metal_backend.m
